# Graph / Arquitetura

```
REQ-001 (Auth)
  → Component: auth.ts (createSession, getCurrentUser, requireUser)
  → Component: storage.ts (Storage.insertSession, getSessionByTokenHash)
  → Component: login-logger.ts (logLoginAttempt)
  → Component: portal-api.ts (loginFn, registerFn, meFn)
  → Tests: auth.test.ts, login-flow.test.ts, n8n-login-flow.test.ts

REQ-002 (Cadastro)
  → Component: storage.ts (Storage.insertUser, getInviteByHash, insertInvite)
  → Component: portal-api.ts (registerFn, expectedRegistrationCode)
  → Component: auth.ts (publicUser, publicUserWithFunctions)
  → Tests: storage-extended.test.ts, storage.test.ts

REQ-003 (RBAC)
  → Component: storage.ts (Storage.listRoleFunctions, grantUserFunction)
  → Component: lib/rbac.ts (userCan, roleLabel)
  → Component: portal-api.ts (grantUserFunctionFn, revokeUserFunctionFn, listRoleFunctionsFn)
  → Tests: rbac.test.ts, rbac-profiles.test.ts

REQ-004 (Tarefas)
  → Component: storage.ts (Storage.insertTask, updateTaskColumn, listTasks)
  → Component: portal-api.ts (createTaskFn, moveTaskFn, deleteTaskFn)
  → Component: routes/index.tsx, routes/admin.tsx
  → Tests: Nenhum específico para tarefas (órfão detectado)

